1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch16","children":["FOSA丨16丨面向服务架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨16丨面向服务架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十六章的课后思考题，深入探讨面向服务架构的历史驱动力与核心理念、四种主要服务类型的特征与职责、SOA衰落的关键因素分析，以及技术分层与领域分层的架构特性、领域复用与操作复用的实现机制，帮助理解面向服务架构的企业级设计原理和服务编排思想，提升架构师在构建大型企业系统时的服务化架构选择能力和SOA设计水平。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-22T11:02:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/22"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,387"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十六章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What was the main driving force behind service-oriented architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"SOA 的主要驱动力是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are the four primary service types within a service-oriented architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"SOA 的四种主要服务类型是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"List some of the factors that led to the downfall of service-oriented architecture."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"列举一些导致 SOA 衰落的因素。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Is service-oriented architecture technically partitioned or domain partitioned?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"SOA 是技术分层还是领域分层？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"How is domain reuse addressed in SOA? How is operational reuse addressed?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"SOA 中如何解决领域复用和操作复用问题？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"背景","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#背景","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#背景"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"背景","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":4,"offset":711},"end":{"line":29,"column":6,"offset":713}}}]},"children":"背景"}]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What was the main driving force behind service-oriented architecture"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"SOA 的主要驱动力是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Is service-oriented architecture technically partitioned or domain partitioned?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"SOA 是技术分层还是领域分层？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"编排驱动的面向服务架构（Orchestration-Driven Service-Oriented Architecture，简称 SOA）是一种在特定时代背景下演变而来的软件架构风格。它在 20 世纪 90 年代末企业快速扩张、需要更复杂的 IT 系统来适应增长的背景下出现。"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"资源稀缺性"}],"：在开源操作系统尚未被认为足够可靠用于严肃工作之前，操作系统和商业数据库服务器的许可费用昂贵且按机器收费。这导致架构师们被要求尽可能地实现",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"重用"}],"，以优化成本。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["$L8","：SOA 的一个主要目标是实现服务层面的重用，即逐步构建可随时间增量重用的业务行为。大型公司厌倦了重复编写软件，因此采取了逐步解决这个问题的策略。"]}],"\n","$L9","\n"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17"]}]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}],"$L1b"]}]]}]}]
